<BlogLayout
  title="Realistic expectations for home-service marketing"
  seoTitle="Realistic Expectations for Home Service Marketing"
  description="What Google can and can’t do for a trade company, timelines, plateaus, and why more budget isn’t always more booked jobs. Set expectations before you spend."
  date="September 2026"
